post.description:
Parses CITATION.cff and formats it as APA and BibTeX. NOT_FOUND when absent;
INVALID_ARGUMENT (subcode `bad_citation`) when it does not parse.

Shape: unary.

Creates a lightweight or annotated tag. ALREADY_EXISTS when the name is taken;
POLICY_DENIED when tag protection forbids it.

Shape: unary.

Parses a repo's FUNDING.yml (root, then `.github`, then `docs`). NOT_FOUND when absent;
INVALID_ARGUMENT (subcode `bad_funding_file`) when it does not parse.

Shape: unary.

Edits a tier. The amount of a tier with active sponsors cannot change (INVALID_STATE);
retire it and create a new one.

Shape: unary.

Adds an SSH key for git authentication. ALREADY_EXISTS when the key is registered;
INVALID_ARGUMENT (subcode `weak_key`) for disallowed algorithms or sizes.

Shape: unary.

Completes an avatar upload. INTEGRITY when bytes do not match `sha256`;
INVALID_ARGUMENT (subcode `bad_image`) when not a supported image.

Shape: unary.
